{"unit":7,"items":30,"pass":21,"title":"Unit Test · Unit 7","html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Unit Test\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Unit 7 &middot; Unit Test</div>\n      <h2>On the move</h2>\n      <p data-t=\"gx258\">Thirty questions on Unit 7 only. Answer them all, then press Check. You need <b>21 out of 30</b> to pass &mdash; and you can take this test as many times as you like.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"review-u7\">\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-t=\"u7r101\">Part 1 &middot; Grammar &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 1&ndash;14</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u7r102\">Choose the correct form.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">I think cities &hellip; much quieter in twenty years.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">will be</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">are being</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">Take an umbrella. It &hellip; rain later.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">might</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">will definitely</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">would</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Traffic jams &hellip; disappear by themselves.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">won&rsquo;t</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">don&rsquo;t will</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">Fares &hellip; go up next year, but nobody is sure yet.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">might</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">will certainly</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">would</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u7r103\">Complete with one word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">There&rsquo;s <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"somebody|someone\" data-why=\"A person, positive sentence: <b>somebody</b> / <b>someone</b>.\"> at the door.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">We went to the island in February. There was <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"nothing\" data-why=\"<b>Nothing to do</b> &mdash; one negative word is enough.\"> to do.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">7</span><span class=\"body\">I want to go <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"somewhere\" data-why=\"A place, positive sentence: <b>somewhere</b> hot.\"> hot this summer.</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u7r104\">Choose the correct adjective.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">8</span><span class=\"body\">The journey was very &hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">tiring</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">tired</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">tire</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">9</span><span class=\"body\">By the end of it I was completely &hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">exhausting</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">exhausted</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">exhaust</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">10</span><span class=\"body\">The guidebook is absolutely &hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">fascinated</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">fascinating</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u7r105\">Each sentence has one wrong word. Click it.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">11</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"2\" data-why=\"<b>Nobody</b> is already negative: <i>Nobody came to reception</i>.\"><span class=\"ew\">Nobody</span> <span class=\"ew\">didn&rsquo;t</span> <span class=\"ew\">come</span> <span class=\"ew\">to</span> <span class=\"ew\">reception</span></span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">12</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"5\" data-why=\"After <b>will</b> the verb is plain: <i>it will rain</i>.\"><span class=\"ew\">I</span> <span class=\"ew\">think</span> <span class=\"ew\">it</span> <span class=\"ew\">will</span> <span class=\"ew\">to</span> <span class=\"ew\">rain</span></span></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u7r106\">Write the sentence again so that it means the same.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">13</span><span class=\"body\">Perhaps we will hire a car.<br>We <input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"might hire a car|may hire a car\" data-why=\"<i>Perhaps</i> &rarr; <b>might hire a car</b>.\"> .</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">14</span><span class=\"body\">The film was boring.<br>I was <input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"bored by the film|bored\" data-why=\"The film causes the feeling (<i>-ing</i>); the person has it (<i>-ed</i>): <b>bored</b>.\"> by the film.</span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-t=\"u7r107\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 2 &middot; Vocabulary &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 15&ndash;24</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u7r108\">Complete each sentence with one word or phrase.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">15</span><span class=\"body\">We couldn&rsquo;t move for an hour &mdash; we were stuck in a <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"traffic jam\" data-why=\"A <b>traffic jam</b> is a long line of vehicles that cannot move.\">.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">16</span><span class=\"body\">Tickets are cheaper if you <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"book\" data-why=\"<b>Book in advance</b> = arrange and pay before the day.\"> in advance.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">17</span><span class=\"body\">Take out travel <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"insurance\" data-why=\"<b>Insurance</b> pays your costs if something goes wrong.\"> in case something goes wrong.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">18</span><span class=\"body\">We stayed in a cheap <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"hostel\" data-why=\"In a <b>hostel</b> you often share a room with other travellers.\"> and shared a room with four people.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">19</span><span class=\"body\">Good evening. I have a <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"reservation\" data-why=\"A <b>reservation</b> is an arrangement made in advance to keep a room for you.\"> under the name Samson.</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u7r109\">Choose the correct word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">20</span><span class=\"body\">The bus is never late. It is very &hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">reliable</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">convenient</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">greener</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">21</span><span class=\"body\">Is breakfast &hellip; in the price?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">included</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">available</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">spare</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">22</span><span class=\"body\">The village is two hours from the nearest town. It is very &hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">basic</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">remote</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">foreign</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u7r110\">One word in each group does not belong. Click it.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">23</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"4\" data-why=\"The others go into the tank. A <b>fare</b> is what you pay for the journey.\"><span class=\"ew\">petrol</span> <span class=\"ew\">diesel</span> <span class=\"ew\">fuel</span> <span class=\"ew\">fare</span></span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">24</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"4\" data-why=\"The others are things you take on holiday. <b>Reception</b> is a place in a hotel.\"><span class=\"ew\">luggage</span> <span class=\"ew\">guidebook</span> <span class=\"ew\">currency</span> <span class=\"ew\">reception</span></span></span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-t=\"u7r111\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 3 &middot; Function &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 25&ndash;30</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u7r112\">Choose the correct phrase.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">25</span><span class=\"body\">I&rsquo;d like to &hellip; , please. The name&rsquo;s Samson.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">check in</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">check out</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">check</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">26</span><span class=\"body\">There&rsquo;s a problem &hellip; the heating.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">with</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">of</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">for</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">27</span><span class=\"body\">Which request is the most polite?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">&ldquo;Send someone up.&rdquo;</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">&ldquo;Could you send someone up this afternoon, please?&rdquo;</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">&ldquo;I want someone now.&rdquo;</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u7r113\">Complete with one word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">28</span><span class=\"body\">What time do we have to check <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"out\" data-why=\"<b>Check out</b> = pay and leave at the end of your stay.\"> tomorrow?</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">29</span><span class=\"body\">Could I have a <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"spare\" data-why=\"<b>Spare</b> = extra, kept ready in case it is needed.\"> towel, please?</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u7r114\">Put the three parts of the note in the usual order.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">30</span><span class=\"body\">\n        <div class=\"order\" data-order=\"r1,r2,r3\">\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"r2\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">There&rsquo;s a problem with the heating in room 412.</span></button>\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"r1\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">Dear Reception,</span></button>\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"r3\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">Could you send someone up this afternoon, please?</span></button>\n        </div>\n      </span></div>\n\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"checkReview(this)\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Check my answers</button>\n      <div class=\"res\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"reviewResult\" class=\"review-result\"></div>\n  </section>\n"}